Local changes:
  - airconv_thunks.{c,h} removed (call DXMT SM50* entry points we do not ship);
    replaced by d9mtair_thunks.{c,h} in the same dispatch style, backed by the
    v2/airlib compile core (AirBuilder + LLVM).
  - winemetal.h / winemetal_thunks.{c,h} / unix/winemetal_unix.c: additive
    ABI entries, appended to keep existing values stable:
      #1 vertex-descriptor-capable render PSO creation (unix call 153).
      #2 per-slot sampler + vertex-texture render commands — the wmtcmd render
         encoder gains WMTRenderCommandSetFragmentSamplerState,
         WMTRenderCommandSetVertexTexture, WMTRenderCommandSetVertexSamplerState
         (appended after SetArgumentBufferOffset in enum WMTRenderCommandType),
         replayed as [setFragmentSamplerState:/setVertexTexture:/
         setVertexSamplerState: atIndex:] in the render encodeCommands switch.
         Reuses the existing wmtcmd_render_settexture shape plus a mirrored
         wmtcmd_render_setsamplerstate (obj_handle_t sampler + uint8 index).
         No new unix-call slot: these ride the existing encodeCommands chain.
         D3D9 binds 16 flat sampler slots + vertex textures; DXMT's D3D11 model
         binds via argument buffers, so upstream's wmtcmd lacked these.
